    <description><![CDATA[Gantt Chart Group 3
History
Feb 18th: First draft based on Example
Feb 25th: Finished preliminary version of Gantt Chart (We have a critical path now)
- Ensure every item has a connection after
- looked into resource totals, need to reallocate
- critical path follows general form Documents, software, Testing, Scheduled Demo scheme which feels right
Feb 25th: Update times for second meeting
updated for week 3, not the actual gantt chart, please take with grain of salt some extrenuating circumstances occurred, I will explain at meeting. 
update this will become actual gantt chart, lost other one when I had to flee montreal due to coronavirus and forgot to recover it first
Marth 30th: Post Coronavirus update,includes two days after meeting 3 and March 30th to Marth 32nd in time sheet (School technically cancelled before then)
]]></description>
